      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "For cases in which significant genotype × environment interaction is revealed by ANOVA or other means, a closer look at the data often reveals that the estimated norms of reaction have a wide variety of shapes, parallel in some ranges of environments, diverging in others, and intersecting on occasion (Figure 22.4).",
